# First-order RC low-pass filter driven by an AC source. Exercises the
# acsource symbol, a horizontal resistor, a vertical capacitor and the
# Vin/Vout labelling of a two-port.
circuit RC low-pass filter

acsource  2  8  v  AC1
label 3 2.3 Vin
wire 2 5  2 3  5 3
resistor  8  3  h  R1  1k
wire 11 3  14 3
dot 14 3
capacitor 14  6  v  C1  100n
wire 14 3  17 3
label 17.5 3.3 Vout
wire 2 11  2 12  14 12
wire 14 9  14 12
gnd 8 12
dot 8 12
